# Build context for server/Dockerfile (run from the repo root).
#
# The image only needs: package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml, pnpm-workspace.yaml,
# shared/ and server/. Everything below is either rebuilt inside the image or
# irrelevant to the backend — keeping it out shrinks the context that GitHub
# Actions uploads on every build.

.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Never let a developer's local secrets into the build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Not needed by the server image.
extension
docs
Promo_Images
deploy
*.md
*.zip
Caddyfile
docker-compose.yml
render.yaml
